'''B.B.Bunny''' (ウサ銀, ''Usagin'') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy that appears in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] and [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].

