==Enemy==
A quick enemy that can easily be dispatched with the use of [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]] or similar [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] units. It is recommended to kill this enemy quickly as it gives a fair amount of money to the player. Larger groups of B.B.Bunnies can cause quick, repeating damage that can cripple larger, slower units.

==Strategy==
B.B.Bunny is generally a very easy enemy to deal with, as it is basically a Red version of [[Baa Baa]]. You can usually dispatch a [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cat]], Axe Cat or any other anti-Red unit. It is recommended to use [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Cats with Area Attack]], such as [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]] or another spammable attacker like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]], as they can easily pick off groups of B.B.Bunnies. Since Bird Cat has low health, use [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]] or other defensive cats to protect it.

After the first few encounters, B.B.Bunny does not pose a real, serious challenge, and offers cash more than anything.

