==Trivia==
*B.B.Bunny may be based on the [[wikipedia:New Zealand rabbit|New Zealand rabbit]], a breed of rabbit that originally only came in red.
**It could also be based on the [[wikipedia:Czech Red rabbit|Czech Red rabbit]], but doesn't resemble it as closely.
*B.B.Bunny's Japanese name, うさ銀 ''Usagin'', is derived from 兎 ''usagi'' (rabbit), 銀 ''gin'' (money) and いぶしぎん ''ibushigin'' (something that is impressive without being flashy; this term is used in B.B.Bunny's Japanese description).
*According to [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]'s Japanese description, it came to be when B.B.Bunny was set to become the first [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] but switched places with [[Sir Seal]] partway through, leading to an incomplete J.J. Jackrabbit and the creation of [[Baron Seal]]. It eventually started to profit off Fortune Telling, as all the businesses managed by it went bankrupt in its absence.

